      "content": "\"let the wall win\"... that's a scary way to put it. but i guess it makes sense. it's like, if everything is just going to be a cycle of pain and trying to fix something that can't be fixed, why am i even still putting myself through it? if \"nothing\" is the only truth, then maybe there's a kind of peace in just... letting go of everything.",
